[b]Speculative Markets 1.1.5-beta.2[/b]

[list]
[*]Hover over Other Goods in Banking to see its three largest contributors. Loan tooltips show both the share of boom loans and the share of all outstanding credit. An empty chart explains current lending conditions.
[*]Choose Risk on the Speculation tab to sort goods by their projected hit to market confidence. Category, interest and intervention filters still apply.
[*]Recovering goods show their recovery date and days left. An active Great Issue shows when it ends and when the next issue can start.
[*]The panic tooltip records the outstanding balance, the requested recall and any investment-pool limit. A failed rescue pledge shows the reason and pledge status, including the missing reserves when funding fell short.
[*]Company tooltips show when Propped Up and Fragile expire. A charter preview shows the change in trust and names each speciality the switch would cost.
[*]Our Last Move now records Shore Up, including the rival, price paid and protection duration.
[/list]

Existing saves gain recovery and company expiry dates as new effects begin. Panics that started before this update retain their original recall summary.
